          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Although functionality is in place to keep the battery management functinal even when the device is sleeping it may not always work. Use these settings if you want to be certain of the behaviour when the device is sleeping.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Although functionality is in place to keep the battery management functinal even when the device is sleeping it may not always work. Use these settings if you want to be certain of the behaviour when the device is sleeping."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "虽然已采取措施，让电池管理在设备睡眠时继续运行，但可能无法始终正常工作。如果您希望确保设备睡眠时按预期运行，请使用这些设置。"
