    "Calibrating your battery helps macOS get a more accurate reading of its health and time remaining. This process can take several hours and involves a full charge and discharge cycle. Sleeping will be disabled during calibration.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calibrating your battery helps macOS get a more accurate reading of its health and time remaining. This process can take several hours and involves a full charge and discharge cycle. Sleeping will be disabled during calibration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "校准电池有助于 macOS 更准确地读取电池健康状况和剩余使用时间。此过程可能需要数小时，包括一次完整的充放电循环。校准期间将禁用睡眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
