    "To control playback with a free account, please open the Spotify desktop app first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To control playback with a free account, please open the Spotify desktop app first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用免费账号控制播放时，请先打开 Spotify 桌面应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To customize the shown icons, right click on the menu bar and select 'Edit Menu Bar Items'. The icons placed in between the dot and expansion icon will always be shown, the icons placed in between the two dots will be hidden when the menu is collapsed, and the icons after the dot will always be hidden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To customize the shown icons, right click on the menu bar and select 'Edit Menu Bar Items'. The icons placed in between the dot and expansion icon will always be shown, the icons placed in between the two dots will be hidden when the menu is collapsed, and the icons after the dot will always be hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要自定义显示的图标，请右键点击菜单栏并选择“编辑菜单栏项目”。圆点与展开图标之间的图标将始终显示；两个圆点之间的图标会在菜单收起时隐藏；圆点之后的图标将始终隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To enable Bluetooth Unlock, Sapphire needs your Mac's login password. It will be stored securely in your system's Keychain and used only to unlock your device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To enable Bluetooth Unlock, Sapphire needs your Mac's login password. It will be stored securely in your system's Keychain and used only to unlock your device."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要启用蓝牙解锁，Sapphire 需要你的 Mac 登录密码。密码将安全地存储在系统钥匙串中，仅用于解锁设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To enable Face ID or Bluetooth Unlock, you must first provide your Mac's login password.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To enable Face ID or Bluetooth Unlock, you must first provide your Mac's login password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要启用 Face ID 或蓝牙解锁，必须先提供 Mac 的登录密码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To enable Spotify integration, please add your API credentials in Sapphire's settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To enable Spotify integration, please add your API credentials in Sapphire's settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 Sapphire 设置中添加 API 凭据，以启用 Spotify 集成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To improve Sapphire, we collect completely anonymous, aggregated usage data. This helps us understand which features are popular, identify bugs, and make the app better for everyone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To improve Sapphire, we collect completely anonymous, aggregated usage data. This helps us understand which features are popular, identify bugs, and make the app better for everyone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为了改进 Sapphire，我们会收集完全匿名的汇总使用数据。这有助于我们了解哪些功能受欢迎、发现问题，并为所有用户改进应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To use Gemini Live, please add your Google AI Studio API key in Sapphire's settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To use Gemini Live, please add your Google AI Studio API key in Sapphire's settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 Sapphire 设置中添加 Google AI Studio API 密钥，以使用 Gemini Live。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
