    "Type a short trigger anywhere and it becomes your text. Use \"{{date}}\", \"{{time}}\", \"{{date:MMMM d}}\" or \"{{clipboard}}\" in the replacement. Sapphire never expands while you type inside Sapphire itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type a short trigger anywhere and it becomes your text. Use \"{{date}}\", \"{{time}}\", \"{{date:MMMM d}}\" or \"{{clipboard}}\" in the replacement. Sapphire never expands while you type inside Sapphire itself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任意位置输入简短的触发词，即可展开为你的文本。替换内容可使用“{{date}}”“{{time}}”“{{date:MMMM d}}”或“{{clipboard}}”。在 Sapphire 内输入时不会触发文本展开。"
          }
        }
      }
