            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将受信任的 Wi-Fi 网络用作位置。在其他网络上或无法获取网络名称时，Face ID 不会启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use your own image or video on the desktop. A video plays behind your desktop icons and pauses whenever the desktop is covered. The lock screen shows it too unless it has its own wallpaper."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在桌面上使用你自己的图片或视频。视频会在桌面图标后方播放，并在桌面被遮挡时暂停。锁定屏幕也会显示此壁纸，除非已单独设置锁屏壁纸。"
          }
        }
      }
